  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/cobweb/banner.png\" alt=\"Cobweb 橫幅\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-5.svg\" alt=\"1.21.5\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-4.svg\" alt=\"1.21.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-3.svg\" alt=\"1.21.3\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"載入器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client-server.svg\" alt=\"覆蓋層\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"問題回報\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h2>📝 <strong>說明</strong></h2><p><strong>Cobweb</strong> 是一個輕量級、模組化的 API，專為簡化跨多個載入器的 Minecraft 模組開發而設計。<br>\n它提供了<strong>統一配置系統</strong>和<strong>統一註冊系統</strong>，兩者均可在通用模組中直接使用。這些系統幫助您抽象化不同載入器之間的差異，讓您可以專注於編寫乾淨、可維護且可重複使用的程式碼，而非繁瑣的樣板代碼。</p><p>Cobweb 是 Crystal Nest 所有專案中共同使用的模組開發 API。<br>\n📚 想深入了解嗎？請查看完整的<a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/cobweb/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcobweb%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/cobweb/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p><h2>✨ <strong>功能特色</strong></h2><p>無論您是為 Fabric 還是 NeoForge 進行開發，Cobweb 都能幫助您統一模組開發工作流程。將其用作多重載入器專案的基礎，或作為依賴項來簡化您的架構！</p><h3>🔄 通用功能（所有載入器）：</h3><ul>\n<li>✅ 統一配置系統 — 一次編寫配置，隨處載入</li>\n<li>✅ 統一註冊系統 — 抽象化載入器特定的註冊方式</li>\n<li>🔍 簡單易用的 API 來獲取遊戲內 ID</li>\n<li>📦 創建並註冊<strong>動態</strong>資源包 <em>（實驗性功能）</em></li>\n<li>📦 創建並註冊<strong>內建</strong>（靜態）資源包</li>\n<li>🌀 用於可變方塊集的動態方塊實體</li>\n</ul><h3>僅 Fabric 功能：</h3><ul>\n<li>📝 簡化的註冊系統。</li>\n</ul><h3>僅 NeoForge 功能：</h3><p>目前無。</p><h2>📜 <strong>授權與使用權</strong></h2><p>歡迎將此模組用於任何模組、模組包或影片中，只需確保標明出處，並儘可能連結<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>即可。<br>\n本專案採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest 社群授權條款 v1</a> 發布。</p><h2>❤️ <strong>支持我們</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 網站\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"我們的其他專案\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
